            @"CYM. Metal-biased SID-808 kit for brighter hats, crashes, ride-like tails, and cleaner top-end response.",
            @"TRK. Tracker-style SID-808 kit with denser chip punch, tighter hats, and more sequenced drum-note coverage.",
            @"TRACE. Forensic/telemetry-biased SID-808 kit for checking scope, and bus behavior while staying on drum-authored content."
