    // coalesce CVDisplayLink→main-queue polls. The vsync callback fires
    // on a high-priority thread at the display cadence (up to 120 Hz); without
    // backpressure a momentarily busy main thread accumulates an unbounded
    // backlog of queued _poll blocks. This flag guarantees at most one _poll is
    // in flight, so the UI naturally drops frames under load instead of lagging.
    std::atomic<bool> _pollInFlight_v246_;
