    // hosting environment exposes no valid vsync timing (e.g. an out-of-process AU
    // view host / AUHostingServiceXPC with no real display association). A
    // CVDisplayLink with indefinite timing free-runs and pegs its IO thread, which
    // Logic surfaces as "this AU may make the system unstable". The timer caps the
    // poll cadence so that can never happen regardless of host.
